WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps,
I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes,
I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes,
I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone,
whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases.
I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.480
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.480 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel,
Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 2]

01:52.820 --> 01:53.500
In the previous life,

01:54.140 --> 01:55.220
the Anping Rebellion erupted

01:55.220 --> 01:56.060
25 days later,

01:56.540 --> 01:57.100
on the very day

01:57.100 --> 01:58.260
of my wedding next month.

01:59.260 --> 01:59.820
Should

02:00.380 --> 02:01.500
the wedding have never taken place,

02:02.380 --> 02:03.460
could the two princes

02:04.100 --> 02:05.500
have survived

02:06.060 --> 02:07.700
and the rebellion been avoided entirely?

02:09.540 --> 02:10.100
Next.

02:12.460 --> 02:13.540
Keep the rhythm in mind.

02:13.700 --> 02:14.300
Just like this.

02:21.180 --> 02:22.100
It's him.

02:26.140 --> 02:26.700
Fu Jiu.

02:29.220 --> 02:30.420
Why haven't you returned to Yunzhong?

02:32.420 --> 02:33.540
I'm under the General's orders

02:34.060 --> 02:34.980
to escort your dowry.

02:35.860 --> 02:36.620
I'll head back

02:36.860 --> 02:37.660
once the wedding is over.

02:37.980 --> 02:38.580
Can you

02:39.300 --> 02:40.380
take me away from here?

02:42.300 --> 02:43.060
Right now.

02:47.340 --> 02:49.540
I only take orders from the General.

03:02.740 --> 03:03.340
Are you

03:04.140 --> 03:04.980
in trouble?

03:16.180 --> 03:16.660
No.

03:34.580 --> 03:36.220
I'm staying at the guesthouse.

03:36.940 --> 03:37.780
If you need anything,

03:38.300 --> 03:39.300
just let me know.

03:44.900 --> 03:45.580
Miss,

03:46.020 --> 03:47.060
what's come over you?

03:47.580 --> 03:48.820
His Highness favors you so much.

03:49.140 --> 03:50.060
Gifts piled mountain-high.

03:50.380 --> 03:51.500
The wedding is just days away.

03:51.700 --> 03:52.740
Why the sudden change of heart?

03:53.140 --> 03:54.260
If you miss the General,

03:54.340 --> 03:55.300
we can always write to him.

03:55.300 --> 03:55.980
I have to go back.

03:58.700 --> 03:59.500
I need

04:00.860 --> 04:01.820
to see my father.

04:03.660 --> 04:04.620
I am surrounded

04:04.620 --> 04:05.620
by Xiao Xun's eyes.

04:06.580 --> 04:07.980
I must find a way out.

04:09.900 --> 04:10.660
Never again

04:12.020 --> 04:14.340
will I let history repeat itself.

04:14.340 --> 04:17.620
[Gaoyang County]

04:29.380 --> 04:30.540
Xie Yanlai, going by the name Fu Jiu,

04:31.300 --> 04:32.540
is now in the Capital

04:32.940 --> 04:34.100
as one of Chu Ling's retainers.

04:34.420 --> 04:35.140
My dear brother

04:35.140 --> 04:36.460
is truly something,

04:37.060 --> 04:38.980
trusted enough by the General

04:39.700 --> 04:41.580
to escort his beloved daughter's dowry.

04:42.540 --> 04:43.540
What of Chu Ling?

04:43.940 --> 04:45.060
Before a century-old lineage

04:45.060 --> 04:46.300
like the Xie clan,

04:46.340 --> 04:46.940
he is but

04:46.940 --> 04:47.900
a lowly general.

04:48.260 --> 04:49.020
Your eldest sister

04:49.020 --> 04:50.340
is the Crown Princess,

04:50.420 --> 04:51.500
with a son for the throne.

04:51.660 --> 04:52.340
Your clout in the court...

04:52.340 --> 04:53.700
Watch your tongue.

04:53.700 --> 04:57.460
[Xie Yanfang, Prime Minister of Chu]

04:58.540 --> 04:59.740
Though my family

04:59.820 --> 05:01.780
once had several grand chancellors,

05:02.580 --> 05:03.780
we remained outsiders

05:03.780 --> 05:05.060
to the Capital's nobility.

05:05.660 --> 05:07.580
Five years ago, I used my failing health
as an excuse

05:07.860 --> 05:08.860
and moved back to Gaoyang,

05:10.340 --> 05:12.380
all to give His Majesty peace of mind.

05:13.500 --> 05:14.340
And yet you,

05:14.860 --> 05:16.140
after all this time at my side,

05:16.900 --> 05:18.620
still haven't learned
to hold your tongue.

05:19.820 --> 05:20.900
My apologies, sir.

05:21.380 --> 05:22.100
Please forgive me.

05:23.860 --> 05:24.780
I fear

05:25.500 --> 05:26.820
his spending too much time

05:26.820 --> 05:27.620
with Chu Ling

05:28.620 --> 05:29.580
has swayed

05:30.060 --> 05:30.980
his loyalty.

05:31.820 --> 05:33.340
Five years without a firm hand,

05:34.300 --> 05:35.420
and even the most obedient

05:35.420 --> 05:36.540
will start to forget themselves.

05:38.340 --> 05:39.140
Once he returns,

05:40.100 --> 05:40.780
I'll dull his bite

05:41.500 --> 05:42.220
and clip his wings.

05:43.500 --> 05:44.420
He'll learn.

05:46.820 --> 05:47.780
My hound

05:49.540 --> 05:50.860
never bites the hand that raised it.

05:51.380 --> 05:52.740
As for Xiao Xun...

05:54.380 --> 05:55.380
With his wedding so near,

05:56.260 --> 05:57.100
we might as well drop in

05:57.140 --> 05:58.540
for a drink.

06:00.620 --> 06:01.060
Your Highness,

06:01.380 --> 06:02.100
our spies report

06:02.380 --> 06:03.780
Xie Yanfang is readying his carriage

06:03.940 --> 06:05.140
and looks to be heading out.

06:05.620 --> 06:06.500
He retreated to Gaoyang

06:07.620 --> 06:09.940
on the grounds of poor health

06:10.860 --> 06:12.020
five years ago,

06:12.580 --> 06:13.900
keeping himself

06:15.380 --> 06:16.380
within easy reach

06:16.420 --> 06:18.380
of the Capital.

06:18.980 --> 06:20.260
When Chu Ling was exiled,

06:21.020 --> 06:22.860
the Xie family wasted no time
seizing what they could,

06:23.060 --> 06:24.140
planting their own people

06:24.340 --> 06:25.460
throughout the ministries.

06:26.020 --> 06:27.420
Now, seeing the two princes

06:27.500 --> 06:28.300
at each other's throats,

06:28.980 --> 06:30.100
are they looking to swoop in

06:30.500 --> 06:31.060
like us?

06:31.140 --> 06:32.500
Easier said

06:34.460 --> 06:35.700
than done.

06:36.620 --> 06:38.180
Tie Ying.

06:40.420 --> 06:42.140
There is something
I cannot make sense of.

06:44.220 --> 06:44.940
Why

06:45.820 --> 06:46.700
the sudden frost

06:46.700 --> 06:48.140
from Zhao?

06:49.180 --> 06:50.060
Has the loose tongue

06:51.140 --> 06:52.300
of someone

06:54.220 --> 06:55.340
alerted her?

06:57.340 --> 06:58.580
My loyalty to you

06:58.820 --> 06:59.580
is absolute.

07:04.060 --> 07:04.780
Enough.

07:06.220 --> 07:06.860
Rise.

07:07.500 --> 07:08.820
I know where you stand.

07:10.540 --> 07:12.260
But given this sudden turn,

07:13.340 --> 07:14.300
we can no longer afford

07:15.420 --> 07:16.460
to wait.

07:17.380 --> 07:19.540
Tomorrow, we'll use the Third Prince

07:19.700 --> 07:20.580
to remove the Crown Prince.

07:20.980 --> 07:23.460
His fall will drive the other to revolt,

07:23.620 --> 07:26.260
and I will be there to restore order.

07:26.700 --> 07:27.700
But Zhao

07:28.260 --> 07:29.340
is a wild card.

07:29.900 --> 07:32.100
The longer we wait,
the greater the risk.

07:56.300 --> 07:56.820
Le.

07:57.740 --> 07:58.460
What's happening?

07:58.820 --> 08:00.180
The Third Prince
has turned on the Crown Prince

08:00.260 --> 08:01.260
and staged a coup.

08:02.460 --> 08:03.180
It was supposed to happen

08:03.180 --> 08:04.660
on the wedding day next month.

08:05.700 --> 08:06.980
Why has it come early?

08:12.100 --> 08:12.780
His Highness orders

08:12.980 --> 08:13.860
your protection.

08:14.340 --> 08:16.100
Please stay in the Chu Mansion

08:16.580 --> 08:17.300
until further notice.

08:17.570 --> 08:19.420
[Anping Rebellion (Past Life)]

08:19.420 --> 08:20.060
Where is Xun?

08:20.220 --> 08:20.900
His Highness orders

08:21.180 --> 08:22.020
your protection.

08:22.220 --> 08:24.100
Please stay in the Chu Mansion.

08:28.260 --> 08:29.980
It's starting

08:30.340 --> 08:31.260
exactly like the rebellion.

08:54.260 --> 08:55.420
His brother, Chu Lan,

08:55.940 --> 08:57.220
poisoned the eldest imperial grandson

08:57.820 --> 08:59.340
in the first year of Anping.

09:00.780 --> 09:01.380
Miss,

09:01.660 --> 09:02.260
what's wrong?

09:02.460 --> 09:03.140
Let's run.

09:03.860 --> 09:04.300
Le,

09:04.580 --> 09:05.460
go fetch Fu Jiu

09:05.660 --> 09:06.300
from the guesthouse.

09:06.500 --> 09:07.180
What about you?

09:07.660 --> 09:08.580
I'm saving the imperial grandson.

09:09.060 --> 09:09.660
Miss,

09:09.860 --> 09:10.740
your life is what matters.

09:10.780 --> 09:11.420
Why worry

09:11.420 --> 09:12.460
about the imperial grandson now?

09:12.620 --> 09:13.300
If he truly dies

09:13.300 --> 09:14.540
by my uncle's hand,

09:14.900 --> 09:15.660
when the reckoning comes,

09:15.780 --> 09:16.860
none of my family will be spared.

09:17.260 --> 09:18.420
Le, go.

09:19.180 --> 09:19.860
Hurry up.

09:20.500 --> 09:20.980
Understood.

09:28.900 --> 09:29.780
If Uncle

09:30.380 --> 09:32.020
was truly the murderer,

09:33.100 --> 09:33.740
then wherever he is,

09:34.540 --> 09:35.540
so is the imperial grandson.

09:47.640 --> 09:49.260
[Chu Lan, Chu Zhao's uncle]

09:49.260 --> 09:50.660
Turns out

09:52.060 --> 09:53.180
it was really him.

09:54.500 --> 09:55.660
He's been in Xiao Xun's pocket

09:55.660 --> 09:56.620
all along.

09:57.780 --> 09:59.100
So, the poisoning of Crown Prince,

09:59.620 --> 10:00.700
the seizure of Third Prince,

10:01.140 --> 10:02.860
and the murder of the imperial grandson
were all Xiao Xun's doing.

10:04.620 --> 10:05.860
He was behind the rebellion

10:05.860 --> 10:06.980
from the very start.

10:12.880 --> 10:15.580
[​Imperial Ancestral Temple​]

10:15.580 --> 10:16.060
Your Highness,

10:16.380 --> 10:17.220
the army is assembled

10:17.420 --> 10:18.620
and awaits your command.

10:18.860 --> 10:19.900
Take your death-sworn

10:20.260 --> 10:21.140
to the Crown Prince's place

10:21.780 --> 10:22.460
and slaughter

10:23.220 --> 10:24.380
every last soul.

10:24.860 --> 10:25.460
Yes,

10:25.620 --> 10:26.140
Your Highness.

10:26.420 --> 10:27.380
Once our forces

10:27.500 --> 10:28.540
breach the imperial palace,

10:29.140 --> 10:29.980
the throne

10:30.500 --> 10:31.580
will have a new master.

10:34.100 --> 10:35.700
The Third Prince
poisoned the Crown Prince,

10:36.220 --> 10:37.020
massacred the Eastern Palace,

10:37.340 --> 10:38.380
plotted against the late Emperor,

10:38.820 --> 10:39.820
and raised a rebellion.

10:40.100 --> 10:41.780
His crimes demand death!

10:44.500 --> 10:45.460
Rest assured, Your Highness.

10:46.740 --> 10:47.620
I shall hold

10:48.340 --> 10:50.420
the throne for you.

10:57.820 --> 10:58.300
Don't be afraid.

10:58.540 --> 10:59.260
I am Chu Zhao,

10:59.420 --> 11:00.500
daughter of the Guard General, Chu Ling.

11:00.620 --> 11:01.300
Follow me.

11:01.700 --> 11:02.580
Silence.

11:02.900 --> 11:04.060
[Xiao Yu, the eldest imperial grandson]
Xiao Xun massacred the Eastern Palace.

11:04.060 --> 11:04.740
His crimes are unforgivable.

11:04.820 --> 11:06.180
As his betrothed,

11:06.260 --> 11:07.500
you are definitely complicit.

11:07.580 --> 11:09.220
Do not come here playing the savior!

11:09.220 --> 11:10.540
I am pledged to him,

11:10.820 --> 11:12.380
but my family serves only the Crown.

11:12.820 --> 11:13.580
You came to Chu Mansion

11:13.580 --> 11:14.340
in your extremity

11:14.620 --> 11:15.900
because you know this to be true.

11:15.980 --> 11:16.460
Am I right?

11:19.660 --> 11:20.700
His Majesty tasked me

11:20.780 --> 11:21.660
to guard His Highness

11:22.620 --> 11:23.340
and find Chu Lan here

11:23.780 --> 11:25.060
if danger arose.

11:25.540 --> 11:26.140
But

11:26.460 --> 11:27.340
where is he now?

11:27.700 --> 11:28.740
My uncle has taken ill.

11:28.980 --> 11:29.580
He bade me

11:29.580 --> 11:30.780
to bring you out before he drifted away.

11:32.820 --> 11:33.860
My father holds

11:34.420 --> 11:35.580
His Majesty's absolute trust.

11:36.220 --> 11:37.220
Xiao Xun's men

11:37.580 --> 11:38.820
are closing in,

11:39.180 --> 11:40.220
and we are defenseless here.

11:40.420 --> 11:41.380
To wait

11:41.500 --> 11:43.100
is to surrender to them.

11:43.940 --> 11:44.820
Our only chance

11:45.460 --> 11:46.580
is to break out now.

11:47.180 --> 11:47.740
If...

11:49.060 --> 11:50.180
it isn't safe here,

11:51.220 --> 11:52.460
where's left to go?

11:53.660 --> 11:54.460
What

11:54.900 --> 11:56.460
can you possibly do?

12:02.140 --> 12:03.500
We're going to Yunzhong.

12:05.500 --> 12:06.860
To find my father,

12:08.020 --> 12:09.380
the Guard General, Chu Ling.

12:26.020 --> 12:26.620
Mr. Fu.

12:28.140 --> 12:28.780
Mr. Fu.

12:31.540 --> 12:32.140
Where is Chu Zhao?

12:32.300 --> 12:33.580
She was off to save
the imperial grandson,

12:33.820 --> 12:34.340
yet there is

12:34.340 --> 12:35.380
no sign of her.

12:35.540 --> 12:36.580
She must have fled.

12:38.700 --> 12:39.500
Everyone, come with me

12:39.780 --> 12:40.380
and find Chu Zhao.

12:40.580 --> 12:41.220
I'm coming too.

12:42.060 --> 12:42.820
Stay here.

12:43.700 --> 12:44.460
You'll only slow me down.

12:54.340 --> 12:54.940
The Flame Decree.

12:59.220 --> 12:59.940
Have someone

13:00.300 --> 13:01.300
set it off in an hour.

13:02.700 --> 13:03.140
Let's go.

13:09.220 --> 13:12.280
[Eastern Palace]

13:18.860 --> 13:19.420
Your Highness,

13:19.940 --> 13:20.620
we have swept the area.

13:20.900 --> 13:21.860
There are no survivors.

13:22.820 --> 13:23.700
How is Zhao?

13:24.420 --> 13:25.420
What of the Chu Mansion?

13:25.900 --> 13:27.220
We have men stationed there.

13:31.660 --> 13:32.540
Your Highness,

13:34.020 --> 13:35.340
I hope you and Yu

13:36.580 --> 13:38.020
will be reunited

13:39.260 --> 13:40.540
with the Crown Prince soon.

13:49.300 --> 13:50.340
This is not Xiao Yu.

14:00.060 --> 14:00.500
Go.

14:00.540 --> 14:00.980
Yeah.

14:13.300 --> 14:14.100
Please rest assured.

14:14.460 --> 14:15.620
My father sent an escort

14:15.620 --> 14:16.220
with the dowry.

14:16.540 --> 14:17.900
I've sent word for them to come for us.

14:20.820 --> 14:21.420
Le,

14:22.540 --> 14:24.100
please find Jiu.

14:25.020 --> 14:25.940
Back then,

14:27.260 --> 14:29.820
Chu Ling built the Longwei Army for me,

14:30.460 --> 14:32.060
with fire as the call.

14:33.300 --> 14:36.900
Only the Flame Decree
could command their blade.

14:37.820 --> 14:39.740
He promised me

14:40.940 --> 14:42.700
that as long as they stood,

14:44.020 --> 14:47.100
I would never be in danger.

14:47.820 --> 14:49.220
He broke his word.

14:53.660 --> 14:55.180
He broke it.

15:38.420 --> 15:39.300
Your Highness, why

15:39.300 --> 15:40.540
didn't you just stay put?

15:47.540 --> 15:48.540
With all this chaos,

15:49.740 --> 15:50.940
I was honestly terrified

15:51.820 --> 15:52.900
and trying to find Xun

15:53.460 --> 15:55.220
when I happened to run into
His Highness.

15:56.220 --> 15:57.380
Tie Ying, good timing.

15:58.420 --> 15:59.340
Help me

15:59.700 --> 16:01.020
escort him back to the palace.

16:01.540 --> 16:02.540
I see.

16:03.340 --> 16:04.380
I'll have someone

16:04.580 --> 16:06.020
take you back to the mansion.

16:06.580 --> 16:08.260
You may entrust him to me.

16:11.500 --> 16:12.860
He is far too shaken

16:12.860 --> 16:13.620
to leave my side.

16:15.540 --> 16:16.340
Where is Xun?

16:20.140 --> 16:20.860
Perhaps we can wait

16:21.500 --> 16:22.380
for him here.

16:22.380 --> 16:23.060
I must insist

16:23.060 --> 16:24.260
that you hand him over.

16:34.580 --> 16:36.260
Give him to me right now.

17:55.700 --> 17:57.020
What took you so long?

18:06.740 --> 18:07.260
Chu Zhao,

18:07.900 --> 18:08.420
I'm taking you

18:09.020 --> 18:10.100
back to Yunzhong.

18:11.740 --> 18:12.180
Fall back.

18:12.780 --> 18:13.260
Wait.

18:17.300 --> 18:18.780
My orders leave no room for waiting.

18:20.060 --> 18:21.220
The General's orders

18:22.020 --> 18:22.940
are to bring you back

18:23.580 --> 18:24.860
alive.

18:26.700 --> 18:28.020
Zhao, are you leaving?

18:28.500 --> 18:29.540
Aren't you going to take me

18:29.540 --> 18:30.860
to my grandfather?

18:35.900 --> 18:36.860
What's your relationship

18:37.980 --> 18:38.820
with Xie Yanfang?

18:41.700 --> 18:42.260
Tell me.

18:45.260 --> 18:46.380
What

18:48.940 --> 18:49.980
is your connection?

18:53.260 --> 18:54.300
Why does it matter?

18:55.540 --> 18:56.900
He is Xiao Yu,
the late Crown Prince's son

18:57.500 --> 18:59.460
and the sole heir to the throne.

19:01.260 --> 19:01.860
Fu Jiu,

19:02.780 --> 19:04.020
you must protect him.

19:04.180 --> 19:05.380
I take orders from one person,

19:06.220 --> 19:07.260
and it isn't you.

19:12.500 --> 19:13.620
A large force is closing in.

19:16.740 --> 19:17.420
What are you doing?

19:17.540 --> 19:18.660
My orders are to get you out.

19:18.980 --> 19:19.820
No one else is my concern.

19:20.300 --> 19:21.020
What about him?

19:21.260 --> 19:21.780
If he is meant

19:21.780 --> 19:22.780
to survive,

19:23.100 --> 19:24.020
it will be so.

19:24.660 --> 19:25.620
If not,

19:26.220 --> 19:27.420
there is no point dying for him.

19:28.540 --> 19:29.780
Stay here and keep him safe.

19:29.940 --> 19:30.500
Yes.

19:32.980 --> 19:33.860
Zhao!

19:39.340 --> 19:40.340
Back then,

19:40.740 --> 19:42.860
Jiu got me out of here just like this.

19:47.000 --> 19:48.120
[Anping Rebellion (Past Life)]

19:50.980 --> 19:51.380
Stop.

19:51.740 --> 19:52.220
Put me down.

19:52.740 --> 19:53.740
I have to find Xun.

19:53.940 --> 19:54.820
I am charged

19:55.220 --> 19:55.780
with your safe return

19:55.780 --> 19:56.620
to Yunzhong.

19:58.660 --> 19:59.460
I am charged

19:59.780 --> 20:00.420
with your safe return

20:00.460 --> 20:01.220
to Yunzhong.

20:03.540 --> 20:04.820
I cannot let Xiao Xun take the throne.

20:13.980 --> 20:14.420
Chu Zhao,

20:15.020 --> 20:15.740
have you lost your mind?

20:16.260 --> 20:17.220
I have to go back.

20:17.260 --> 20:17.780
Not a chance!

20:19.980 --> 20:20.340
Move.

20:22.340 --> 20:22.860
Fu Jiu,

20:24.020 --> 20:24.820
you must keep me alive,

20:25.260 --> 20:26.380
or you'll be disobeying orders.

21:00.100 --> 21:01.180
This way. Hurry!

21:01.860 --> 21:02.900
Here!

21:03.620 --> 21:04.380
Zhao.

21:53.340 --> 21:54.260
Follow me

21:54.980 --> 21:56.140
and protect His Majesty.

21:56.420 --> 21:57.580
- Yes! - Yes!

22:07.300 --> 22:08.300
There are more of them coming.

22:09.060 --> 22:09.740
What do we do?

22:10.620 --> 22:11.220
Don't worry.

22:12.740 --> 22:14.060
I'll die before you do.

22:19.460 --> 22:25.780
- Kill! - Kill!

22:47.900 --> 22:49.460
He's here.

22:50.380 --> 22:51.060
By my order,

22:51.740 --> 22:52.740
comb the city.

22:53.380 --> 22:54.780
Anyone resembling the imperial grandson

22:55.180 --> 22:55.980
is to be killed on sight.

22:56.460 --> 22:57.180
The rest of you,

22:57.460 --> 22:58.140
follow me

22:58.460 --> 22:59.300
into the palace!

23:24.900 --> 23:25.580
Excuse me.

23:26.620 --> 23:28.020
Who set off the Flame Decree?

23:28.460 --> 23:28.980
I did.

23:29.340 --> 23:31.220
The Longwei Army has existed

23:31.700 --> 23:33.460
for over a decade,

23:33.860 --> 23:34.780
yet this is the first time

23:34.780 --> 23:35.540
I have seen it.

23:36.620 --> 23:37.660
So my father

23:38.020 --> 23:39.260
commands not only the frontier troops,

23:40.340 --> 23:41.020
but also

23:41.020 --> 23:42.380
this secret army.

23:44.660 --> 23:46.260
So this is the army

23:47.460 --> 23:48.420
he mentioned.

23:53.540 --> 23:54.380
This is the Flame Decree.

23:54.780 --> 23:55.580
It commands

23:55.580 --> 23:56.620
a secret army.

23:57.060 --> 23:58.700
The late Emperor
had me train them in secret,

23:58.740 --> 23:59.700
just for times like this.

24:01.020 --> 24:02.100
They will help you

24:02.900 --> 24:03.580
protect the Capital

24:04.260 --> 24:05.020
and Zhao.

24:11.020 --> 24:12.220
With them on our side,

24:13.420 --> 24:14.340
leaving here

24:15.060 --> 24:15.980
just got a little easier.

24:16.700 --> 24:17.340
Last time,

24:17.820 --> 24:19.140
Xiao Xun marched on the palace

24:19.540 --> 24:20.700
and the decree was never set off.

24:21.260 --> 24:22.060
The army

24:22.060 --> 24:23.180
stayed unknown to anyone.

24:23.980 --> 24:24.660
But now,

24:25.460 --> 24:26.260
they are my hand

24:26.940 --> 24:27.660
to play

24:27.700 --> 24:28.780
against his bid for the throne.

24:28.940 --> 24:29.660
Scouts.

24:30.020 --> 24:30.580
- Yes! - Yes!

24:34.540 --> 24:35.300
Go and clear the path.

24:35.900 --> 24:37.460
Try to avoid the Lord of Xiaonan's men.

24:38.060 --> 24:39.140
The rest of you, follow me

24:40.220 --> 24:41.020
out of the city now!

24:41.180 --> 24:41.740
- Yes! - Yes!

24:41.940 --> 24:42.340
No, wait.

24:46.340 --> 24:47.540
With the army behind us,

24:48.060 --> 24:49.580
there is no need to flee.

24:50.940 --> 24:51.540
Where are you going?

25:04.340 --> 25:05.580
To the palace.

25:10.980 --> 25:11.460
Your Majesty,

25:12.140 --> 25:12.900
with both the princes

25:13.460 --> 25:14.540
fallen,

25:15.300 --> 25:16.380
the heir to the Lord of Xiaonan

25:16.380 --> 25:18.060
is coming soon to protect Your Majesty.

25:18.300 --> 25:20.060
[Deng Yi, Attendant Censor]

25:20.060 --> 25:20.940
Your Majesty,

25:22.220 --> 25:23.260
you must act now.

25:23.980 --> 25:25.540
This brother of mine

25:26.100 --> 25:29.740
was always the patient one.

25:30.300 --> 25:31.220
Yet now, even he

25:32.980 --> 25:35.940
reached his breaking point.

25:37.060 --> 25:38.100
Tell me,

25:39.060 --> 25:40.740
who is truly fit

25:41.020 --> 25:43.820
to inherit my throne?

25:45.260 --> 25:46.060
Your Majesty,

25:46.060 --> 25:47.420
is the one you have in mind

25:48.580 --> 25:49.540
the Lord of Xiaonan,

25:50.620 --> 25:51.700
or his son?

26:02.420 --> 26:03.700
After all these years,

26:04.500 --> 26:07.820
you still know me better than anyone.

26:09.700 --> 26:10.660
Go...

26:12.060 --> 26:12.900
and draft the decree.

26:14.980 --> 26:15.420
Yes, Your Majesty.

26:37.900 --> 26:38.620
We are escorting

26:38.620 --> 26:39.820
His Highness back to the palace.

26:39.900 --> 26:40.740
Open the gates at once.

26:41.580 --> 26:42.860
He is an impostor.

26:43.500 --> 26:44.300
His life is forfeit.

26:44.740 --> 26:46.340
On my command, cut him down on sight!

27:05.500 --> 27:06.900
Your commander has committed treason

27:07.860 --> 27:08.820
and been executed!

27:09.860 --> 27:10.860
Redeem yourselves now

27:11.740 --> 27:13.260
and all will be forgiven.

27:13.620 --> 27:14.780
Those who resist

27:15.820 --> 27:16.380
will be slain!

27:43.020 --> 27:43.980
Can we win

27:44.420 --> 27:45.260
a head-on fight?

27:45.860 --> 27:47.140
The gates will fail.

27:48.180 --> 27:49.060
It's only a matter of time.

27:50.740 --> 27:51.820
The moment Xiao Xun enters the city,

27:52.700 --> 27:54.300
the first one he'll kill is him.

27:54.900 --> 27:55.700
The second

27:56.980 --> 27:57.740
will be you.

28:02.340 --> 28:04.020
Was that really him

28:04.660 --> 28:05.860
who just charged in?

28:06.300 --> 28:06.900
Ram the gates.

28:18.460 --> 28:19.100
Is it worth it?

28:21.300 --> 28:22.180
Worth a try.

28:25.460 --> 28:25.940
Very well.

28:27.620 --> 28:28.540
We shall hold the gates

28:29.260 --> 28:30.220
as commanded,

28:31.220 --> 28:32.180
even unto death.

28:32.180 --> 28:33.240
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

28:33.480 --> 28:37.640
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

28:37.780 --> 28:41.380
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

28:41.380 --> 28:41.940
Jiu.

28:41.940 --> 28:43.180
♪I'm my own pawn♪

28:43.180 --> 28:43.740
Take care.

28:44.960 --> 28:49.000
♪I sigh at my fate♪

28:49.400 --> 28:55.920
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

28:56.440 --> 29:01.360
♪All the sand is washed away♪

29:02.600 --> 29:07.520
♪An old dream fades♪

29:08.540 --> 29:10.380
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

29:10.380 --> 29:11.220
As the General said,

29:11.900 --> 29:12.780
if the gates fall,

29:13.140 --> 29:14.060
we are no soldiers.

29:14.660 --> 29:15.980
If we are to die today,

29:16.420 --> 29:17.940
let it be at these very gates!

29:18.220 --> 29:19.940
- No retreat! - No retreat!

29:20.220 --> 29:21.860
- No retreat! - No retreat!

29:22.060 --> 29:23.740
- No retreat! - No retreat!

29:23.900 --> 29:26.020
- No retreat! - No retreat!

29:26.040 --> 29:28.760
♪Schemes within schemes,
I prison myself♪

29:28.840 --> 29:31.960
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

29:32.080 --> 29:35.080
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

29:35.380 --> 29:41.180
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

29:42.900 --> 29:44.500
Xiao Xun is truly without mercy.

29:44.860 --> 29:46.100
The entire Eastern Palace

29:46.180 --> 29:47.300
has been massacred.

29:47.820 --> 29:48.980
Even the Crown Princess
and her son were...

29:53.500 --> 29:55.100
Nothing is more real

29:58.420 --> 29:59.900
than blade and blood.

30:02.660 --> 30:04.300
The throne of State of Chu

30:05.260 --> 30:06.540
shall never

30:07.740 --> 30:08.860
belong to Xiao Xun.

30:14.180 --> 30:14.780
Du Qi,

30:15.660 --> 30:16.780
​muster the troops

30:17.900 --> 30:19.100
and head to the Capital.

30:25.380 --> 30:25.940
Your Highness,

30:26.420 --> 30:27.260
I have failed you.

30:28.340 --> 30:29.380
I was careless

30:30.620 --> 30:31.980
to have underestimated Chu Ling.

30:33.740 --> 30:34.580
Her Ladyship

30:35.060 --> 30:35.980
took the imperial grandson.

30:41.180 --> 30:41.700
Zhao.

30:43.180 --> 30:44.780
You've found something out after all.

30:53.020 --> 30:54.300
Anyone entering unsummoned

30:54.700 --> 30:56.020
shall die.

30:56.580 --> 30:57.820
I am Chu Zhao, daughter of Chu Ling,

30:57.820 --> 30:58.940
the Guard General of Yunzhong.

30:59.340 --> 31:00.420
I have escorted His Highness back

31:00.700 --> 31:01.540
and request an audience.

31:30.200 --> 31:31.120
[Deng Yi, Attendant Censor]

31:36.620 --> 31:37.300
Deng Yi?

31:39.100 --> 31:40.420
You know me?

31:41.060 --> 31:42.540
You were the Grand Mentor,

31:43.060 --> 31:44.580
the person Xiao Xun trusted most.

31:45.220 --> 31:46.460
Of course I do.

31:50.020 --> 31:51.100
It is plain to see

31:52.220 --> 31:53.340
Deng Yi must have had a hand

31:53.340 --> 31:54.500
in the rebellion.

31:56.380 --> 31:56.940
You

31:58.420 --> 31:59.300
and I

31:59.860 --> 32:01.300
have met before.

32:18.780 --> 32:19.580
Greetings,

32:20.460 --> 32:21.700
Your Highness.

32:26.620 --> 32:27.780
His Majesty is unwell

32:28.540 --> 32:29.780
and cannot receive you.

32:35.700 --> 32:36.700
Your brush tells

32:37.300 --> 32:38.340
quite a crooked tale.

32:39.300 --> 32:41.140
Shall I charge your clan

32:42.580 --> 32:44.140
with treason with my brush

32:44.820 --> 32:45.980
for tonight's trespass?

32:47.620 --> 32:49.020
What did Xiao Xun promise you?

32:50.020 --> 32:50.820
The Nine Bestowments,

32:51.940 --> 32:53.540
or the first honors
for backing his rise?

32:55.540 --> 32:57.380
The Crown Prince's heir
stands before you.

32:58.220 --> 32:59.020
Which do you think

32:59.740 --> 33:01.180
leaves a finer mark

33:01.180 --> 33:02.860
in history?

33:03.780 --> 33:04.980
Kingmaking for a usurper,

33:04.980 --> 33:06.020
or guiding

33:06.220 --> 33:07.340
a young emperor to glory?

33:09.860 --> 33:10.620
And do you believe

33:11.100 --> 33:12.380
Xiao Xun, once enthroned,

33:12.660 --> 33:13.580
would spare

33:13.620 --> 33:15.340
a historian who knows the truth

33:15.500 --> 33:16.860
of how he seized power?

33:19.900 --> 33:21.420
But if His Highness takes the throne,

33:21.820 --> 33:22.340
you will be

33:22.980 --> 33:24.140
the founding pillar of his reign,

33:24.140 --> 33:25.100
first among all ministers,

33:25.820 --> 33:27.260
with every word of history

33:27.620 --> 33:29.020
yours to write.

33:43.100 --> 33:43.980
Miss Chu,

33:45.220 --> 33:46.260
please escort

33:46.980 --> 33:48.540
His Highness to the Emperor.

34:03.220 --> 34:03.820
Your Highness.

34:04.340 --> 34:05.460
I am Yu.

34:06.420 --> 34:06.980
Alright.

34:07.780 --> 34:08.260
Yu,

34:09.260 --> 34:10.380
from now on,

34:11.500 --> 34:13.900
our lives are bound

34:14.380 --> 34:15.420
together.

34:17.300 --> 34:17.980
My father

34:19.220 --> 34:20.780
is the person His Majesty trusted most.

34:21.140 --> 34:21.860
And I want

34:23.380 --> 34:25.260
to be that person for you.

34:25.820 --> 34:26.980
You will always be the one

34:26.980 --> 34:28.020
I trust most.

35:20.340 --> 35:20.900
Your Majesty,

35:21.140 --> 35:22.460
Chu Zhao, daughter of Chu Ling,

35:22.820 --> 35:24.860
has escorted His Highness back.

35:29.940 --> 35:31.140
I, Chu Zhao, daughter of Chu Ling,

35:31.140 --> 35:32.260
the Guard General of Yunzhong,

35:32.540 --> 35:33.660
pay my respects to Your Majesty.

35:40.300 --> 35:44.340
Like father, like daughter.

35:45.180 --> 35:48.220
Bold beyond measure

35:48.300 --> 35:49.820
and utterly without restraint.

35:51.300 --> 35:51.860
Your Majesty,

35:52.460 --> 35:53.300
the trespass

35:53.580 --> 35:54.700
was never my wish.

35:55.580 --> 35:57.020
Mr. Qi brought His Highness

35:57.020 --> 35:57.860
to my place for refuge,

35:58.500 --> 35:59.540
and my father's men happened

35:59.780 --> 36:00.660
to be in the Capital.

36:01.260 --> 36:02.060
In that dire hour,

36:02.420 --> 36:03.900
I mobilized the Longwei Army

36:04.180 --> 36:05.180
to guard the throne

36:05.980 --> 36:07.660
and ensure the safe return

36:07.820 --> 36:08.820
of His Highness.

36:11.580 --> 36:13.340
Rise.

36:26.020 --> 36:26.860
Grandfather.

36:39.180 --> 36:41.860
I sent him away

36:41.940 --> 36:43.900
to keep him safe.

36:44.900 --> 36:46.500
And now you bring him back

36:46.500 --> 36:48.660
to this very danger.

36:49.540 --> 36:50.220
What

36:51.700 --> 36:53.220
is your intent?

36:54.100 --> 36:54.660
Your Majesty,

36:55.060 --> 36:56.460
Xiao Xun

36:56.500 --> 36:58.380
plotted against the princes,

36:59.100 --> 37:00.300
hunted your grandson,

37:00.780 --> 37:02.660
and harbors treason
against Your Majesty.

37:03.340 --> 37:05.620
Though betrothed to him,

37:05.860 --> 37:07.460
I will not stand by and watch a traitor

37:07.540 --> 37:08.300
run rampant.

37:11.420 --> 37:11.940
Imperial Physician!

37:16.780 --> 37:17.500
Do not be afraid.

37:18.060 --> 37:19.700
He will be fine.

37:24.300 --> 37:25.820
If His Majesty were to die now,

37:26.460 --> 37:27.980
not only would I fail to stop Xiao Xun,

37:28.380 --> 37:30.220
but he would frame me for regicide.

37:31.260 --> 37:32.060
Everything

37:32.820 --> 37:34.420
I have fought for would be lost.

37:38.220 --> 37:39.020
We can't hold much longer!

37:39.300 --> 37:40.980
Get Miss Chu out of here!

37:41.780 --> 37:43.100
With that tally,

37:43.180 --> 37:44.340
[Imperial Guard]
they won't stop you!

37:45.620 --> 37:46.700
Hold on!

37:47.420 --> 37:48.180
Stand firm!

37:53.460 --> 37:55.380
See?

37:56.620 --> 37:57.740
I am poisoned

37:58.300 --> 37:59.260
and will not see the dawn.

38:00.500 --> 38:02.180
The decree of succession

38:02.500 --> 38:04.060
is already drawn.

38:05.140 --> 38:06.500
By daybreak,

38:07.780 --> 38:10.780
Xiao Xun will be the new emperor.

38:12.780 --> 38:13.940
Deng Yi will escort

38:13.940 --> 38:15.220
you both to safety.

38:18.180 --> 38:18.660
Your Majesty,

38:19.620 --> 38:21.180
would you truly hand this realm over

38:21.300 --> 38:22.620
to the Lord of Xiaonan and his son?

38:23.140 --> 38:25.220
Can a child of six hold

38:25.220 --> 38:26.700
the throne?

38:30.020 --> 38:30.780
Let it be.

38:31.580 --> 38:33.340
Now that it has come to this,

38:34.500 --> 38:36.060
as long as a Xiao

38:36.100 --> 38:38.220
sits upon the throne,

38:39.140 --> 38:39.700
I can meet

38:41.700 --> 38:45.020
my ancestors with a clear soul.

38:45.860 --> 38:46.620
But Your Majesty,

38:47.260 --> 38:48.700
if His Highness goes to the border,

38:48.860 --> 38:50.140
what is my father to do?

38:51.660 --> 38:52.700
Carve out his own territory

38:53.940 --> 38:55.180
and defy the new emperor

38:56.140 --> 38:57.420
just to protect him?

38:58.460 --> 39:00.820
The troops

39:01.540 --> 39:03.140
under your father's command

39:03.140 --> 39:04.780
need not be involved.

39:05.220 --> 39:06.900
The Longwei Army,

39:06.900 --> 39:08.220
spread across the land, is enough

39:08.260 --> 39:09.900
to keep him safe.

39:09.940 --> 39:10.420
Your Majesty,

39:11.700 --> 39:13.180
willing or not, my father

39:14.020 --> 39:15.060
will be seen as a threat

39:15.060 --> 39:16.140
to the new emperor regardless.

39:16.980 --> 39:18.060
If you trust him

39:18.740 --> 39:19.860
to keep your grandson safe

39:19.860 --> 39:21.260
at the border,

39:21.780 --> 39:22.900
why don't you believe

39:23.620 --> 39:24.820
that he can protect His Highness

39:24.820 --> 39:25.860
holding the throne?

39:30.740 --> 39:32.900
The last thing

39:32.900 --> 39:33.940
your father would ever want

39:34.780 --> 39:37.940
is to hold this realm together for me.

39:51.500 --> 39:55.220
You have reminded me of something.

39:56.020 --> 39:56.820
If

39:57.660 --> 39:59.740
Xiao Xun insists on marrying you,

39:59.780 --> 40:03.380
your father would not stand against him,

40:04.100 --> 40:06.380
and his troops

40:06.380 --> 40:08.420
would become a threat.

40:08.620 --> 40:10.020
It seems

40:11.580 --> 40:12.820
I cannot let you leave either.

40:37.380 --> 40:38.860
As commanded,

40:39.140 --> 40:40.180
whoever kills Chu Zhao

40:40.940 --> 40:41.900
dies by my hand.

40:44.420 --> 40:44.940
Insolence.

40:45.820 --> 40:47.220
You would risk your entire clan

40:47.620 --> 40:48.980
to commit such blatant treason?

40:51.260 --> 40:52.340
I would welcome it.

41:08.700 --> 41:09.580
Go ahead.

41:09.700 --> 41:10.820
Then we die together!

41:11.540 --> 41:12.060
Jiu.

41:22.300 --> 41:22.780
Your Majesty,

41:23.140 --> 41:24.740
please let me
be your grandson's elder sister,

41:26.700 --> 41:27.380
the Grand Princess

41:29.460 --> 41:30.900
of the State of Chu,

41:35.020 --> 41:36.780
and help him

41:38.020 --> 41:39.260
hold the throne.

41:39.900 --> 41:40.660
What did you say?

41:41.260 --> 41:41.980
I know

41:42.780 --> 41:43.780
you and my father

41:43.780 --> 41:44.740
were sworn brothers

41:45.300 --> 41:47.060
before you took the throne.

41:48.660 --> 41:49.740
My title as the Grand Princess

41:50.620 --> 41:52.220
would make my father kin,

41:52.780 --> 41:54.300
not just a subject to your grandson.

41:55.140 --> 41:56.220
And

41:56.780 --> 41:57.580
the frontier troops

41:57.580 --> 41:58.820
and the Longwei Army

41:59.900 --> 42:01.620
become guardians for us both.

42:05.380 --> 42:06.220
So,

42:07.660 --> 42:08.420
that is

42:09.140 --> 42:10.100
His Highness's greatest advantage

42:10.100 --> 42:11.980
in holding the throne.

42:13.500 --> 42:15.740
I may be dying,

42:16.180 --> 42:16.860
but

42:17.180 --> 42:20.020
I've still got enough breath

42:20.060 --> 42:21.460
to kill you and your father,

42:22.060 --> 42:25.260
a plague upon this throne.

42:25.620 --> 42:26.620
Then why not spend it

42:26.620 --> 42:27.740
​securing a future

42:28.100 --> 42:29.580
for the realm?

42:30.620 --> 42:31.620
Xiao Xun's ascension

42:32.460 --> 42:34.180
would invite unrest and rebellion,

42:34.780 --> 42:35.820
and even invasion

42:36.060 --> 42:36.980
from the Northern Desert.

42:38.140 --> 42:38.940
By then,

42:39.820 --> 42:40.660
the people

42:40.660 --> 42:41.860
will be consumed by endless war

42:42.420 --> 42:44.180
and everything will be lost.

42:45.540 --> 42:47.140
How will you ever be able

42:47.580 --> 42:48.380
to face

42:48.740 --> 42:49.660
your ancestors

42:50.220 --> 42:50.860
with a clear conscience

42:50.860 --> 42:52.700
in the afterlife?

43:05.460 --> 43:06.580
The Grand Princess

43:08.700 --> 43:10.740
of the realm...

43:12.500 --> 43:13.380
Please rest assured.

43:14.380 --> 43:15.620
This title

43:15.780 --> 43:16.540
begins with me

43:17.060 --> 43:17.820
and ends with me.

43:19.060 --> 43:20.780
So long as I hold it,

43:21.420 --> 43:22.740
I take no husband

43:23.220 --> 43:23.980
and I bear no child.

43:24.620 --> 43:25.940
I yield my power

43:26.180 --> 43:27.140
to no one,

43:27.820 --> 43:29.100
and I shield no one with my shadow.

43:30.140 --> 43:31.220
Should I break this oath,

43:32.380 --> 43:33.980
I shall be marked a traitor,

43:34.500 --> 43:35.500
and let everyone

43:35.540 --> 43:36.940
be my executioner.

43:38.500 --> 43:39.500
I can wield

43:40.020 --> 43:41.180
a blade against enemies,

43:42.100 --> 43:42.860
and cut

43:43.300 --> 43:44.380
every tie that reaches

43:44.380 --> 43:45.380
for the imperial seal.

43:46.980 --> 43:47.740
What I desire

43:48.580 --> 43:50.500
is for the annals of history to record:​

43:52.380 --> 43:54.500
"Chu Zhao, the Grand Princess
of the State of Chu,

43:55.020 --> 43:56.180
​remained unwed for life.​​

43:58.100 --> 43:59.940
She rests beside her father, Chu Ling,​

44:00.780 --> 44:02.020
at the border.​"

44:25.260 --> 44:25.780
I,

44:26.500 --> 44:28.100
Xiao Xun, heir to the Lord of Xiaonan

44:29.020 --> 44:30.740
request to attend upon Your Majesty!

45:09.100 --> 45:10.580
The Third Prince, Xiao Zhu,

45:11.060 --> 45:12.700
committed treason, murdered his brother,

45:13.220 --> 45:15.260
and massacred the Capital
in a bid for the throne.

45:15.780 --> 45:16.820
​This cannot go unpunished.​

45:17.380 --> 45:19.540
He is stripped of his title
and reduced to commoner status,

45:19.820 --> 45:22.420
and his maternal clan,
the Zhao clan meets extermination.

45:23.140 --> 45:24.700
Xiao Xun, heir to the Lord of Xiaonan,

45:25.100 --> 45:26.180
defended the throne with distinction

45:26.780 --> 45:28.940
and honored the imperial line.

45:32.180 --> 45:32.980
Your Highness.

45:34.180 --> 45:35.340
Please receive the decree.

45:42.340 --> 45:43.420
We, the Xie clan,

45:43.860 --> 45:46.140
have come to your aid, Your Majesty.

45:59.580 --> 46:00.140
It's him.

46:06.660 --> 46:08.420
The stars bring ill omens,

46:08.740 --> 46:09.700
and traitors breed chaos.

46:10.180 --> 46:11.500
Both of my sons have fallen.

46:11.940 --> 46:13.100
It is by the valor and wit of Chu Zhao,

46:13.100 --> 46:14.460
daughter of Chu Ling,

46:14.900 --> 46:15.940
who rode armed

46:16.300 --> 46:17.300
to deliver

46:17.340 --> 46:19.340
the imperial grandson to safety,

46:19.820 --> 46:21.300
that the Xiao ancestral line

46:21.300 --> 46:22.740
endures.

46:23.460 --> 46:24.660
Chu Ling and I once shared

46:24.940 --> 46:25.940
the dust and blood of battle

46:26.180 --> 46:27.340
and swore

46:27.660 --> 46:28.700
a brother's oath.

46:29.620 --> 46:31.260
For the eternal stability of the realm,

46:31.780 --> 46:33.740
I hereby pass the throne

46:38.020 --> 46:39.700
to my eldest imperial grandson, Xiao Yu.

46:46.740 --> 46:48.620
And I confer the title

46:48.740 --> 46:50.380
of Grand Princess upon Chu Zhao.

46:50.940 --> 46:52.860
Her betrothal to Xiao Xun

46:52.860 --> 46:54.100
is hereby severed.

48:05.000 --> 48:09.800
♪Broken walls and withered branches,
trapped in the mire♪

48:09.800 --> 48:12.400
♪Yet still striving
to reach for the sky♪

48:12.400 --> 48:15.960
♪My pride is torn down
and my body is sacrificed♪

48:18.800 --> 48:21.040
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

48:21.040 --> 48:22.640
♪And roars in the blaze♪

48:22.840 --> 48:25.720
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

48:26.080 --> 48:28.520
♪Fate imprisons me♪

48:28.640 --> 48:33.360
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

48:33.720 --> 48:37.720
♪Even if hope is faint,
I remain proud♪

48:38.000 --> 48:41.920
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean,
however long it takes♪

48:42.160 --> 48:46.920
♪However it ends up,
I'll go my own way♪

48:47.600 --> 48:49.320
♪With no fear of the distance♪

48:49.440 --> 48:53.000
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

48:53.240 --> 48:57.400
♪With sword in hand,
I'll pierce the dawn♪

48:57.760 --> 49:03.000
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

49:03.120 --> 49:06.520
♪My new pride♪

49:20.960 --> 49:23.640
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

49:24.120 --> 49:26.600
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

49:26.880 --> 49:28.600
♪Amidst the chaos♪

49:28.600 --> 49:34.520
♪I'll always be with you♪

49:34.600 --> 49:37.120
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

49:37.400 --> 49:38.640
♪And roars in the blaze♪

